{"url": "https://drcollege.ac.in/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://drcollege.ac.in/", "text": "Debraj Roy College : Accredited by NAAC with A Grade in 2023\nNIRF\nWebmail\nRecruitments\nTender\nOld Website\nA-\nA\nA+\nAbout Us\nCollege History\nPrincipal Desk\nVice Principals\nDeans\nVision & Mission\nContact Us\nDepartments\nArts\nAssamese\nEnglish\nEconomics\nEducation\nHistory\nPhilosophy\nPolitical Science\nScience\nBiotechnology\nBotany\nChemistry\nComputer Science\nPhysics\nMathematics\nStatistics\nZoology\nLife Sciences\nProgrammes\nUndergraduate Programmes\nPost Graduate Programmes\nProfessional Programmes\nPh.D Programmes\nCareer Add On Courses\nFYUGP Regulations\nITEP\nClass Routine\nAcademic Calender\nResearch\nResearch Policy\nResearch Cell\nPh.D Regulations\nPh.D Supervisors\nPh.D Scholars\nPh.D Awarded\nPatents/Publications\nResearch Projects\nSeminar Book\nFacilities\nCentre for Innovation & Incubation\nCentral Instrumentation Centre\nSpecially Abled Students\nHistorical Archive\nHealth Centre\nLanguage Lab\nSports & Gymnasium\nBiotech Hub\nHostel\nYoga Centre\nIQAC\nNotifications\nNotification for Sexual Harassment\nAdvertisement for Guest Faculty\nNew\nNotice for Dr. Bani Kanta kakati Merit Award, 2026\nNew\nAdmission Notice B.Sc. B.Ed. 2nd Merit List, 2026\nNew\nITEP Admission notice & Merit List\nNew\nView All\nAdvertisement for Guest Faculty\nWelcome!\nDebraj Roy College came into being in the wake of independence of the country around 1949. In the post independence period, there was a surging atmosphere of great joy and excitement all over the country and this tempo was also felt in an isolated and sleepy town like Golaghat. The college provides an excellent opportunity for interaction among students coming from various ethnic and linguistic background. College has accredited with \"A\" Grade by NAAC, and selected by UGC as Centre with Potential Excellence.\nKnow More\nNAAC Accreditation \"A\" Grade 2023, 3rd Cycle\nCollege with Potential for Excellence(CPE) by UGC, 2010\nWatch Our Campus View\nNews & Events\nNational Seminar on towards Viksit Bharat 2047: Integrating Women's Empowerment Agriculture, Rural Development, and The Indian Knowledge System\nNational Seminar to be held on the 28th January 2026\nNational Science Day Celebration\nThe “Sabera Khannam Memorial Talk” will be held on 5th March, 2025\nNational Seminar on Rural Development Through Women’s Empowerment and Skill Enhancement\nView All\nAdministration\nAdmission\nExamination\nCentral Library\nAwards and Recognitions\nAutonomous Certificate\nNAAC Accreditation \"A\" Grade 2023, 3rd Cycle\nCollege with Potential for Excellence(CPE) by UGC, 2010 and 2014\nFaculty\nAdministrative Staff\nUndergraduate Students\nPostgraduate Students\nPhD Research Scholars\nDistinguished Alumni\nOur Distinguished alumni serve as role models, inspiring current and future students by demonstrating the impact an education can have on personal and professional development.\nSee All\nDr Binoy K Saikia, Principal Scientist, CSIR NEIST\nWinner of Shanti Swarup Bhatnagar Prize-2021 Govt of India and Assam Saurav Civilian Award-2023\nDr. Nagen Saikia, Litterateur, Former Member of Parliament.\nSahitya Academy Awardee.\nDr. Arupa Kalita Patangia, Litterateur\nSahitya Academy Awardee\nOur Activities\nCommunity Service\nNational Service Scheme\nNCC\nRed Ribbon Club\nEco Club\nNewsletter\nPublications\nGallery\n75th Foundation Day\nDebraj Roy College\nActivity\nMisc. Gallery\nNSS Activities\nSports Activities of Teachers\nNSS Activities 1\nStudents Sports Activities\nWorkshop On NEP\nArchive\nView All\nOur Collaborations\nOur Recruiters\nContact Address\nCircuit House Road, Golaghat, Assam, India.Pin-785621\n03774-451224(Principal) 284482(office), 285607(Fax)\nprincipal@drcollege.ac.in\nFollow Us :\nImportant Links\nRTI\nDownload\nPhoto Gallery\nOur glorious past Videos\nNational Council for Teacher Education\nQuick Links\nDibrugarh University